    "## 8. Topic Modeling — NMF sobre TF-IDF\n",
    "\n",
    "Identificamos los principales temas que aparecen en las reseñas, entrenando el modelo con el corpus completo (Currys + todos los competidores) para que los topics sean comparables entre empresas."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "c7d8e9f0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Matriz TF-IDF: 1,100 documentos × 2,790 términos\n",
      "NMF completado.  W: (1100, 8)  H: (8, 2790)\n",
      "\n",
      "=== TOPICS IDENTIFICADOS (palabras más representativas) ===\n",
      "Usa estas palabras para asignar un nombre a cada topic en la siguiente celda.\n",
      "\n",
      "  Topic 0: order, customer, customer service, service, item, refund, stock, days, told, ordered, company, email\n",
      "  Topic 1: delivery, time, day, delivered, date, slot, day delivery, delivery time, delivery date, item, driver, deliver\n",
      "  Topic 2: tv, richer, sounds, richer sounds, new, new tv, bought, great, set, box, price, screen\n",
      "  Topic 3: machine, washing machine, washing, old, installation, appliance, old machine, appliance city, city, new, delivered, install\n",
      "  Topic 4: product, good, great, price, excellent, quick, easy, website, delivery, fast, prices, service\n",
      "  Topic 5: fridge, freezer, fridge freezer, old, appliance, new, delivery, away, guys, delivery guys, man, american\n",
      "  Topic 6: phone, condition, battery, iphone, bought, backmarket, market, screen, new, good condition, good, came\n",
      "  Topic 7: staff, store, helpful, shop, went, online, friendly, collect, member, help, pick, wanted\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# ── TF-IDF ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "vectorizer = TfidfVectorizer(\n",
    "    max_features=5_000,\n",
    "    min_df=3,\n",
    "    max_df=0.90,\n",
    "    ngram_range=(1, 2),     # unigramas y bigramas\n",
    "    stop_words='english'\n",
    ")\n",
    "X_tfidf = vectorizer.fit_transform(df['review_clean'])\n",
    "feature_names = vectorizer.get_feature_names_out()\n",
    "print(f\"Matriz TF-IDF: {X_tfidf.shape[0]:,} documentos × {X_tfidf.shape[1]:,} términos\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── NMF ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "nmf = NMF(n_components=N_TOPICS, random_state=42, max_iter=500, init='nndsvda')\n",
    "W = nmf.fit_transform(X_tfidf)   # matriz Documento × Topic\n",
    "H = nmf.components_               # matriz Topic × Palabra\n",
    "print(f\"NMF completado.  W: {W.shape}  H: {H.shape}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Topic dominante por reseña\n",
    "df['topic']       = W.argmax(axis=1)\n",
    "df['topic_weight'] = W.max(axis=1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Mostrar palabras por topic\n",
    "print(\"\\n=== TOPICS IDENTIFICADOS (palabras más representativas) ===\")\n",
    "print(\"Usa estas palabras para asignar un nombre a cada topic en la siguiente celda.\\n\")\n",
    "for idx in range(N_TOPICS):\n",
    "    top_idx  = H[idx].argsort()[::-1][:TOP_WORDS]\n",
    "    top_words = [feature_names[i] for i in top_idx]\n",
    "    print(f\"  Topic {idx}: {', '.join(top_words)}\")"
   ]
  },
